# Structure And Reuse Rules

- If a screen file grows beyond 300 lines, split it into a dedicated folder:
  - `app/<screen>/index.tsx` for logic/JSX
  - `app/<screen>/styles.ts` for `StyleSheet` definitions
- Keep screen logic lean; move reusable UI blocks into separate components.
- Any modal that can be reused must be extracted into `src/components/` (or a subfolder there), not duplicated inside screens.
- Reused components must be prop-driven and imported wherever needed.
- Avoid copy-paste UI across screens; extract once and reuse.

## Example Structure

```txt
app/profile/index.tsx
app/profile/styles.ts
src/components/modals/ConfirmActionModal.tsx
```
